flowchart TD
    A[User opens web application] --> B{Input method}
    B -->|Typed text| C[Enter message in chat box]
    B -->|Voice input| D[Browser Web Speech API converts speech to text]
    D --> C
    C --> E[JavaScript sends message to Flask /api/chat]
    E --> F[NLP processing module]
    F --> G[Tokenization]
    F --> H[Sentiment analysis]
    F --> I[Keyword extraction]
    F --> J[Text classification]
    G --> K[Rule-based chatbot response]
    H --> K
    I --> K
    J --> K
    K --> L[Save chat and NLP metadata to database]
    L --> M[Return JSON response to frontend]
    M --> N[Display bot response and NLP output]
    N --> O{Speak output?}
    O -->|Yes| P[Browser Speech Synthesis API reads response aloud]
    O -->|No| Q[End interaction]
    P --> Q
